Interpretation for the paper/story:
  Host interconnect bandwidth is rising, but data-center PCIe bandwidth is
  also power/signal-integrity constrained. Simple Copy is interesting only if
  experiments show host CPU/DRAM/PCIe savings are not simply replaced by worse
  device media, GC, latency, or QoS costs.


